From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] train: use the string converters without importing GraphQL

ModelTrainer only uses Graphene for its two string conversion helpers.
The Graphene dependency cannot be resolved with the distribution's GraphQL
3.3 package. Include the unchanged helpers and their upstream tests from
Graphene 3.4.3 so training does not pull in the GraphQL stack.

The copied files remain covered by the bundled upstream MIT license.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [distribution dependency compatibility]
Reference: https://github.com/graphql-python/graphene/issues/1609
Reference: https://github.com/graphql-python/graphene/blob/v3.4.3/graphene/utils/str_converters.py
Reference: https://github.com/graphql-python/graphene/blob/v3.4.3/graphene/utils/tests/test_str_converters.py
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
